; WHO 22 sound diffusion: the WHAT values a gateway forwards on the amplifier 3#1#1
; (*22*WHAT*3#1#1##).
; Boundary probe of 2026-11-16 and 2026-11-17 on the 13 emulated gateways: WHAT 0..35, 40, 50,
; 99, 100, 101, 255, 1000, 9999. The frames that at least one gateway does not answer at all
; are in sound-who22-what-range-no-reply.
;
; Result (stock settings, two identical runs per target, 13 targets): per group below, the
; gateways that forward the frame to the bus or answer it on the event session, and the
; gateways whose daemon crashes. Gateways not named drop the frame.
;
; ORACLE ONLY: frames of this file crash a daemon on at least one emulated gateway; do not send
; them to a real gateway.

; 1. *22*N*3#1#1##
;    CRASH on 3488, F453, F453AV, F454, F459, F460, F461, MH200N, MyHomeServer1
